{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "fc26206364d665c3ab7b176334d4d4cb8360157537637df88dcd3467770bdcd9", "ja": "動き出す歯車", "zh": "转动的齿轮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fbfef46a5a56c2e95f67b0a217404204332e55937ce1a2c565e035c7df269749", "ja": "モモコの案内で、セリカは謎の青年ミナコと\nともに、メカニックのユキホの工房に赴く。\nそこにいたのは飛行士のメグミ。さらには\nミナコが、高性能ロボットの長、マツリの\n打倒を計画していることがわかる。", "zh": "在桃子的带领下，星梨花与神秘青年美奈子\n一同前往机械师雪步的工坊。\n在那里的是飞行员惠美。此外还得知，\n美奈子正计划打倒高性能机器人的首领茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "1e69c3924ebda7323cb661fa1fb4783eb4a0b83896cd84035fde2d47e65fa336", "ja": "……はぁ～、美味しかった！　おかげで助かったよ。\n目が回って倒れそうだったんだ。", "zh": "……哈～，真好吃！多亏了你，得救啦。\n我刚才都头晕得快要倒下了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "d0eaf9f4bd622a2892f6607cff7598055a770811a60f4ab41166cfc587efc9c0", "ja": "よかったです。えぇと、ミナコ……さん。", "zh": "太好了。那个，美奈子……小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "94d6d4b887f5f7c42359de2a423a4143c667549493170423082bbd96a594a62c", "ja": "ミナコでいいよ！\nあ、でもごめん、実は持ち合わせがないんだよね……。", "zh": "叫我美奈子就好啦！\n啊，不过抱歉，其实我身上没带钱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "f4af602f73a4dc2c6334a5fd387691cd8a27abdcac7b464483749a0d6e98b1df", "ja": "ですよね。お腹がすいて倒れるくらいだし。\n……いいですよ。「困った時はお互い様」だから。", "zh": "就是嘛，毕竟都饿到要晕倒了。\n……没关系啦。因为“谁都有遇到困难的时候嘛”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "e47c256bf282e6c7e1598288ce46a997afe1651b6b50bfd612f293814f394be2", "ja": "え、いいの！？　さっきの肉まん、売り物だよね？\nなのに……。優しい！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？刚才的肉包是要卖的吧？\n明明这样……你真温柔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "d4127af531790a4769b458870b68d515b56b072dda8a7c8a6c47d70cd24bd45c", "ja": "別に、そんなんじゃ……。", "zh": "没、没什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "c353718e13ceeb63483e673f3a80cda24df347af79a5c9a3b7dfd39034b11763", "ja": "（でも、この辺りじゃ見かけない人だな。\n旅人……にも、見えないけど……？）", "zh": "（不过，这附近可没见过这样的人。说是旅行者……看起来也不像……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "513662ee3ae5fbc2f928bb8db2b7acd218d75a3bd3bc5da43f5fd73f1db517fe", "ja": "ところで、セリカはずっと、\nこの街で商売をしているの？", "zh": "话说回来，星梨花一直都在这座城里做生意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "1e2715594da36dd5ea8254a4d5883c209ceeb022f83fc00033e14355f2fb758c", "ja": "あ、はい。\nそうですね、ここ最近はいつもここで。", "zh": "啊，是的。\n最近一直都在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "3b318e225888608d3d7baabfe9c342c96f755b82676e3676f4d36fe4ee43883d", "ja": "そっか。それじゃ『賢者の石』って、聞いたこと\nないかな？　この辺りにあるらしいんだけど。", "zh": "这样啊。那你听说过“贤者之石”吗？听说就在这附近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "347ad402a1141f5802406093ccebe2034afca993c70017c2d8cefc5ad582ffb9", "ja": "『賢者の石』？　知らないです。\nなんですか、それ？", "zh": "“贤者之石”？我不知道。\n那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "9b70e6ad3016a97785f9621576cf90fd4b447db1509bd6b779f0ebcc97e5987e", "ja": "知らないか。まあいいや。お腹もいっぱいになったこと\nだし、そろそろ行かなくちゃ。ありがとうね、セリカ。", "zh": "不知道啊。算了。肚子也吃饱了，差不多该走了。谢谢你，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7a42808f36888aa3edb96815564c1c4f6101557420af2fd9561cbccb19c93094", "ja": "行くって、どこへ？", "zh": "要去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "34c95b17f946a27187e1a4330eb57633cb97d80b0ab5d06695708c77adedfdea", "ja": "ちょっと王城まで。\nマツリを、倒しにね。", "zh": "去一趟王城。\n去打倒马茨莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "4654937bc332a0a910f00e4c061b4536e43b0b02dd0b536a371e276460b1b8ab", "ja": "？　マツリを……ええっ！？\nま、待って、マツリって、高性能ロボットの……？", "zh": "？　要打倒玛茨莉……什么！？等、等一下，玛茨莉是那个高性能机器人的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "ee9ba5d0e5fab19c03772081f6558bb680d24787a8790f76b523c8f1583312b9", "ja": "うん。今、この国は大変な状態だからね。\n止めなくちゃと思って。", "zh": "嗯。现在这个国家正处于非常危急的状态。\n我觉得必须阻止它才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "07e59281ead94798e19973bcb2cc82bad72bfb6136206ee9f597f4d986a8be6e", "ja": "止めるって……本気ですか！？　だいたい、ロボットの\nいる機械都市は警備も厳重で、近づくことだって……！", "zh": "你说要阻止……是认真的吗！？再说了，机器人所在的机械都市戒备森严，想要靠近都……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "34860765b34410f7ebec1473ce1c1486a652f8f37b3f4a2608a7c724ec8b94be", "ja": "まあ……なんとかなるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "哎……总会有办法的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab2bf9e861236194a2b5b993426097e8e70028413740ea987f2946fe7d04a9c9", "ja": "ならないと思う！　お金がないなら装備もないでしょ？\n空だって、飛空艇がないと飛べないし！", "zh": "我觉得不行！没钱的话，也就没有装备吧？\n就算想飞上天空，没有飞空艇也飞不了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "b3b60fd314f27908a78b6b133650eb8a1b372ac02b50f571ce67c2790186b226", "ja": "……装備。", "zh": "……装备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "698bbd4b9b5cf7b6d2ad8c2e961ce89ecb3eef7dd679ccbbcb5d9979416f6e65", "ja": "ん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "f021ec6f4871f905ff812765dc879d839d63a150efdeb86eccda2bfd4230e4d1", "ja": "うわ、すっごい！　武器の宝庫だね！　これ、\n蒸気式自動機関砲？　こんなでっかいの初めて見た！", "zh": "哇，好厉害！简直就是武器宝库！这个是……\n蒸汽式自动机关炮？这么大的我还是第一次见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "22cca16dac64b18b3453615ed229a1cb08b5a1f2d5719e5c6f6bf8e52c6e024f", "ja": "あっちのアームはなに？　飛空艇に積むの？\n機体は……わ、これかぁ！", "zh": "那边的机械臂是干什么用的？要装到飞空艇上吗？\n机体是……哇，是这个啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "d3dba4814312eecb6e0a9d23e00a720ed39dfc4139b22e295fc8445a986e27b5", "ja": "で、連れてきちゃったの？\nあんた……こないだ屋台で会った子だよね？", "zh": "所以，你把她带过来了？\n你……就是前几天在小摊那儿遇到的那个孩子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "955265e9342a39fde144b6f8e760ad4e1d217c1b7cf84f8e0e948f588346fcc3", "ja": "は、はい。どうも……。", "zh": "是、是的。那个……你好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "8f39bfdea84b5e899c514abecbc18001b84f62af01f6900732972735af86f2f9", "ja": "お邪魔してまーす♪", "zh": "打扰啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "8695cb8acab1d5a0ded17a50ab3a1755790268453c2e5d27219bd9ced7999563", "ja": "いやあんたは誰！", "zh": "不对，你是谁啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "62bfe5b8af4676e589102e0983d7825fbb29236eb8e1c696a70022df9104b5b7", "ja": "お客さん。ほしいっていってた。", "zh": "客人。说想要来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ef5edc2028e73f6df7208c54c9d3aa4c9b003c8c3d628aef894c891f9a9050e", "ja": "でも、無一文なんですよね？\nお金もらえないのは困るんですけど……。", "zh": "可是，您身无分文吧？\n拿不到钱的话，我会很为难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "b5ebe5b46fa48c13392c8c86220e337a65ef842506928d8b94198a678f1f31ed", "ja": "あはは、大丈夫！　借用書を書くよ。\n何なら借金のカタも置いてくし。……はいこれ、指輪。", "zh": "啊哈哈，没关系！我会写借条的。\n要是你不放心，我也可以留下抵债的东西。……给，戒指。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0810871824ea2453fa0522ec07c1c8fbc95726bd2793d35c066065884f0ca8e3", "ja": "はあ……。ん？", "zh": "唉……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "fc18ce07726fa78b5e1fd39b4f2dd37c7f20daba2083ee23a3903fd7e77ada30", "ja": "じゃあ、武器を選んでいい？\nうーん、とりあえず……連発式はこっちかな♪", "zh": "那么，我可以选武器吗？\n嗯……先选这个连发式的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_03_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff2495e9caa0a06fa5b4d8a26745b216b3b8fa8b61e7f69ed5ffdb2695ddb13a", "ja": "武器の選び方、慣れてるよね。\n身のこなしも素人じゃない。……軍人？", "zh": "你很熟练地挑选武器呢。\n身手也不像是门外汉……你是军人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
